{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18213","headline":"送李尚书赴襄阳八韵得长字 · 韩愈","name":"送李尚书赴襄阳八韵得长字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝忧南国切，改命付忠良。\n壤画星摇动，旗分兽簸扬。\n五营兵转肃，千里地还方。\n控带荆门远，飘浮汉水长。\n赐书宽属郡，战马隔邻疆。\n纵猎雷霆迅，观棊玉石忙。\n风流岘首客，花艳大堤倡。\n富贵由身致，谁敎不自强。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}